{
  "_id": "tg-heal",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "I am the Lord that healeth thee, Ex. 15:26. Heal her now, O God, Num. 12:13. every one that is bitten, when he looketh upon it, shall live, Num. 21:8. dipped himself seven times in Jordan … was clean, 2 Kgs. 5:14. I have seen thy tears: behold, I will heal thee, 2 Kgs. 20:5. Lord hearkened … and healed the people, 2 Chr. 30:20. Lord, heal me; for my bones are vexed, Ps. 6:2. I cried unto thee, and thou hast healed me, Ps. 30:2. He healeth the broken in heart, Ps. 147:3. time to kill, and a time to heal, Eccl. 3:3. understand … convert, and be healed, Isa. 6:10 (Matt. 13:15; John 12:40; Acts 28:27; 2 Ne. 16:10). with his stripes we are healed, Isa. 53:5 (1 Pet. 2:24; Mosiah 14:5). waters shall be healed, Ezek. 47:8. Sun of righteousness arise with healing in his wings, Mal. 4:2.",
